    {
      "tag": "druid-table",
      "since": "1.0.5",
      "summary": "Sorting and live filtering for a plain light-DOM table (slotted, never rebuilt).",
      "attributes": [
        {
          "name": "heading",
          "type": "string",
          "default": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "searchable",
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false
        },
        {
          "name": "searchPlaceholder",
          "type": "string",
          "default": "Filter"
        },
        {
          "name": "filter",
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "notes": "the active query; set it from the app to filter without the built-in box."
        },
        {
          "name": "sortable",
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false
        },
        {
          "name": "sort",
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "notes": "column key to sort by: a <th>'s data-key, else its trimmed header text."
        },
        {
          "name": "direction",
          "type": "string",
          "default": "asc"
        },
        {
          "name": "emptyText",
          "type": "string",
          "default": "Nothing matches that filter."
        },
        {
          "name": "boxed",
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "reflects": true
        }
      ],
      "slots": [
        {
          "name": "",
          "purpose": "the app's own <table>, normally <table class=\"df-table\">"
        }
      ],
      "events": [
        {
          "name": "table-filter",
          "bubbles": true,
          "detail": {
            "value": "string — the current query",
            "visible": "number — rows still shown"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "table-sort",
          "bubbles": true,
          "detail": {
            "key": "string — the sorted column's data-key, else its header text",
            "direction": "\"asc\" | \"desc\""
          }
        }
      ],
      "methods": [
        {
          "name": "refresh",
          "signature": "refresh(): void"
        },
        {
          "name": "setFilter",
          "signature": "setFilter(value: string): void"
        }
      ],
      "consumes_css_vars": [
        {
          "var": "--border"
        },
        {
          "var": "--radius-sm"
        },
        {
          "var": "--df-select-bg",
          "affects": "filter input background"
        },
        {
          "var": "--bg-dim"
        },
        {
          "var": "--text"
        },
        {
          "var": "--df-dur"
        },
        {
          "var": "--df-ease"
        },
        {
          "var": "--df-accent"
        },
        {
          "var": "--accent"
        },
        {
          "var": "--focus-ring",
          "affects": "filter input focus halo"
        },
        {
          "var": "--text-muted"
        },
        {
          "var": "--radius"
        },
        {
          "var": "--df-panel-body-bg",
          "affects": "table well behind the rows"
        },
        {
          "var": "--df-panel-header-bg",
          "affects": "header bar of the boxed table"
        },
        {
          "var": "--bg-header"
        }
      ],
      "a11y": "Sorted headers carry aria-sort=ascending|descending; the filter input is labelled from search-placeholder.",
      "example": "<druid-table sortable searchable heading=\"Models\" boxed>\n  <table class=\"df-table zebra\">\n    <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"num\" data-key=\"size\">Size</th><th data-sort=\"none\">Actions</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody><tr><td>gemma</td><td class=\"num\" data-value=\"8100\">8.1 GB</td><td><druid-button>run</druid-button></td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</druid-table>",
      "gotchas": [
        "The table is slotted light DOM: style it with .df-table and render its rows server-side as usual. The component only reorders <tr> nodes and toggles their hidden flag.",
        "Sorting compares a cell's data-value when present, else its text; two values that both parse as numbers compare numerically. Use data-value for anything formatted (\"8.1 GB\", a date).",
        "<th data-sort=\"none\"> opts a column out of sorting (action columns).",
        "Rows added or replaced later are picked up automatically by a MutationObserver; call refresh() only if you mutate rows in a way that does not touch the DOM.",
        "Sticky headers and the scroll container come from .df-table / .df-table-wrap in druids.css, not from this component.",
        "A .df-table is width:100%, so it can never outgrow the scroll container and a narrow viewport squeezes the columns. Add class \"wide\" to the table (or tune --df-table-min-width) to give it a width floor and get horizontal scrolling; tables with 5+ columns get that floor automatically under 720px.",
        "The scroll container only engages if the table's ancestors can shrink: give any grid track minmax(0, ...) and any flex/grid item min-width: 0, otherwise the ancestor grows to the table's floor and the page gets the horizontal scrollbar instead. Applies to the automatic 5+-column floor too, which needs no opt-in."
      ]
    },
