      "a11y": "Bubble is role=tooltip; shows on hover and focus-within, Esc hides it.",
      "example": "<druid-tooltip text=\"Locked while a model is pinned\">\n  <druid-textarea disabled></druid-textarea>\n</druid-tooltip>",
      "gotchas": [
        "Empty or cleared `text` hides the bubble entirely — drive a conditional tooltip by setting/clearing `text` (or set `disabled`).",
        "Bubble renders in the top layer, so scroll/overflow ancestors never clip it; it flips to stay on-screen.",
        "Because the wrapper owns the hover, it fires over a disabled child control (unlike native title)."
